/* Explains the robust fit */
"Takes the slope from the middle of the slopes through every pair of calibrations, instead of the line that best fits all of them at once. One calibration taken at a bad moment is then outvoted rather than dragging the whole correction with it. Needs at least three calibrations." = "Takes the slope from the middle of the slopes through every pair of calibrations, instead of the line that best fits all of them at once. One calibration taken at a bad moment is then outvoted rather than dragging the whole correction with it. Needs at least three calibrations.";

/* Toggle: widen the limits placed on the fitted correction */
"Allow a wider correction" = "Allow a wider correction";

